# PLAN-887 first-wave suite — D-group ACE consumption (3 new obligations).
#
# The suite is SELF-CONTAINED by admission contract (virtual paths may not
# escape the suite root: suite.include and case source paths reject `..`).
# The 30 reuse obligations (B01..B20, U01..U10) are therefore judged by
# running the ORIGINAL delivered suites (ace-m1-base.suite.ad for the B
# rows, ace-m1/entry-862/entry-unit-862.suite.ad for U01..U10) from the
# integration target plan887_test_governance — same sources, same recipes,
# same profiles, zero duplication, identity kept.
#
# D-group sources are byte-identical copies of the ORIGINAL vm corpus files
# (provenance + pilot-recorded sha256 pinned in each case header; the
# integration test re-verifies the originals are untouched):
#   src/arithmetic.at = crates/auto-lang/test/vm/01_basics/002_arithmetic/arithmetic.at (`1 + 2` → 3)
#   src/unary.at      = crates/auto-lang/test/vm/01_basics/006_unary/unary.at (`-2 * 3` → -6)
#   src/group.at      = crates/auto-lang/test/vm/01_basics/007_group/group.at (`(1 + 2) * 3` → 9)

```test-suite
suite { schema: "autolang.suite/2", id: "governance-887-first-wave", include: [
  "d-arithmetic.case.ad",
  "d-unary.case.ad",
  "d-group.case.ad",
] }
```
